From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 12:19:42 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8132-j713: Add the Wi-Fi and Bluetooth
 board type

The J713 radio module is "garden" (ADT /arm-io/wlan module-instance).

Signed-off-by: Youwes09 <yuvi.shen@outlook.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j713.dts | 8 ++++++++
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j713.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j713.dts
index e1fc5d47f487..eb9751b14cb9 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j713.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8132-j713.dts
@@ -30,6 +30,14 @@ led-0 {
 	};
 };
 
+&wifi0 {
+	brcm,board-type = "apple,garden";
+};
+
+&bluetooth0 {
+	brcm,board-type = "apple,garden";
+};
+
 &fpwm1 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
